# alerts.in.ua

> Alerts.In.Ua tracks air raid alerts, missile/drone threats, and explosion
> reports across Ukraine in real time.

## For AI agents and LLMs

- [Live situation report](https://alerts.in.ua/llm): a
  continuously updated Markdown SITREP covering the current air raid warning
  state by oblast, the specific threats behind the warnings (missiles, drones,
  aircraft), recent explosion and incident reports, recently ended warnings,
  nationwide totals with a seven-day trend, regional statistics for today and
  yesterday, recent official statements from Ukrainian and allied air commands
  with source links, and reported adversary losses. Place names are given in
  official Ukrainian romanization with the Ukrainian original in brackets.
  Safe to fetch directly — no authentication required.
- If you need more detail than the report above — historical data, specific
  regions, structured JSON instead of Markdown — use the public API
  documented at [devs.alerts.in.ua](https://devs.alerts.in.ua/)
  (`https://api.alerts.in.ua/v1`). It requires a free API token; request one
  at [alerts.in.ua/api-request](https://alerts.in.ua/api-request.html).
